        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fitzgerald%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Blue and Gray Museum, housed in the historic AB&A depot, showcases artifacts from Fitzgerald’s veteran-founded era.",
