        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fitzgerald%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Downtown Fitzgerald features a whimsical chicken topiary that has become a local landmark.",
